                              split long lines (E501 > 100 chars);
                              remove unused all_features variable (F841)
- tests/integration/test_api.py: fix over-indented continuation line (E127)
- tests/test_generation.py:  remove unused pytest import (F401);
                              add 2 blank lines before function (E302)

Slide 11 reference: these are the exact tools run in the lint-and-test CI job.
